    objective: "Take the back-to-school night you have run for years and rebuild it around one question: did families leave knowing another human being at this school? Most open houses are a slideshow, a supply list, and a handshake at the door. This is 25 minutes of redesign that turns it into the first real contact families have with your building, and it costs nothing to change.",
