    leaderScript: "\"This ridiculous thing is going to move around this building all year. Two rules. You hold it for a week, and you can't pass it back to whoever gave it to you. Before you pass it, you write in this notebook why. Specific. Not 'she's great,' but what she actually did. I'll start. Last Thursday Marisol covered two classes during her prep and never told me, and I only found out because a kid mentioned it. Marisol, it's yours.\"",
