        title: "Debrief at the end of day one",
        minutes: "2 min",
        detail: "Fifteen minutes with the adults who were assigned names. Who came back different. Who did not come back at all. Non-attendance on the first day back is the single loudest signal your building will get all year, and it is routinely written off as a slow start.",
