    leaderScript: "\"I'd like twenty minutes with you sometime in the next few weeks. It's not an evaluation, nothing goes in a file, and I'm not building up to anything. Two questions, and I'm sending them now so you can think: what makes you stay here, and what would make you leave. I'd rather hear the honest version now than read it in a resignation letter in April.\"",
