    beWord: "BE Generous",
    lane: "Staff",
    objective: "Name the staff whose departure would genuinely damage your school, then go and ask each one to come back next year, out loud, individually, in April. January's stay conversations were diagnostic. This is persuasion, and it happens in the weeks when contracts are signed and resignations are filed. The single most common regret in school leadership is assuming a great teacher knew they were valued.",
